          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="New sanctions, shipping restrictions, insurance rules, and enforcement tied to Iran–Gulf escalation force rerouting, additional inspections, and capacity constraints that directly delay and interrupt logistical flows used to sustain Ukrainian military and civilian supply chains." />
