          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A higher frequency of strikes and sabotage attributed to foreign actors creates political pressure that leads parliaments and prosecutors to open inquiries into procurement, export controls, and tech firms' foreign ties, increasing investigative activity." />
