          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="An increased tempo and normalization of kinetic incidents in Ukraine provides operational lessons and legitimizes harder military postures that accelerate force posture adjustments and riskier maneuvers in the Indo‑Pacific, raising regional conflict intensity." />
