          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rising tempo of security incidents tied to the Russia–Ukraine war enables the U.S. executive to invoke national-security authorities and emergency justifications for sanctions, deployments, and intelligence actions, producing faster unilateral decision-making and greater deference from Congress and courts." />
