          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Stronger US partisan polarization increases congressional incentives to use high‑profile hearings and oversight of executive Iran/Gulf policy (to score political points), producing more frequent and aggressive legislative scrutiny of incidents and responses in the Gulf." />
