          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A spike in US–China military incidents and deterrence posturing reallocates diplomatic and military alignments (e.g., deeper China–Iran security cooperation and louder Chinese diplomatic cover), which directly emboldens Iranian Gulf-facing operations and raises the frequency/intensity of incidents in the Gulf." />
          <attvalue for="37" value="0-6 months" />
