          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Escalation in US–China regional confrontations (e.g., Taiwan Strait) draws US/NATO operational and diplomatic focus and can cause redeployment or delayed support to Ukraine, which Russian forces opportunistically exploit to increase the tempo and number of strikes and incidents." />
