          <attvalue for="36" value="Escalating US–China tech regulatory actions (export controls, sanctions on vendors) prompt US and allied pressure on Gulf governments and firms to police Chinese equipment and data flows, directly increasing investigatory and regulatory scrutiny of regional tech projects linked to Iran or Chinese vendors." />
