          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="New and amplified regulatory requirements (export controls, customs inspections, compliance checks) on AI-related hardware/software raise paperwork, require supplier relabeling and vendor audits, and trigger rapid supplier switching that causes immediate delays and bottlenecks in shipments of semiconductors, sensors and drone components used in the Russia–Ukraine theater." />
