          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rapid rise in regulatory scrutiny of AI and data practices creates ambiguous compliance obligations and signals likely new cross‑border restrictions, directly increasing near‑term unpredictability about US policy and regulatory responses toward China." />
